The "official" NetHack 3.1.0 binary for OS/2, NH310OS2.EXE, as compiled
by the NetHack Development Team, OS/2 Dept. (:-) has been uploaded to
ftp-os2.nmsu.edu directory pub/uploads.  It should in time be moved to
directory pub/os2/all/games.  The binary has also been uploaded to
ftp.funet.fi, where it will most probably appear in directory
pub/os2/games-etc.  Note that the latter archive site is in Europe, so
downloaders in the US should use ftp-os2 whenever possible.  The
package has also been submitted to comp.binaries.os2.

The archive file is a self-extracting family-mode archive created by
pkzip 1.02.  It can be unpacked both in DOS and in OS/2.  The binary is a
16 bit binary, which means that it supports all current versions of OS/2.
More information in file README.OS2 in the package itself.

